    { figurka_u_staruchy && los_psa != oswojony:
        His father saw it from the far end of the room, hobbled to the door and without a word drove a knife into the frame – the same one he had kept under his pillow every night since he was a child.
    }
    The music played on, but Jaromir’s merrymaking was over. Every little while he glanced at the window. The dark shape beneath the spruces did not move once until first cockcrow – and then, between one glance and the next, it was gone. # dalej
